                                "sense_id": "a697a557-812a-3528-a727-974bd7f4330a",
                                "text": "\"HS2's London tunnels will help ensure many homes and habitats in the capital remain undisturbed. This is a key part of our commitment to deliver Britain's new high-speed railway in the most environmentally friendly way and minimising disruption to our neighbours,\" said HS2 Ltd Client Director Malcolm Codling."
